WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:06.632
PREVIOUSLY

2
00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.842
Hey. it's me. Uncle.

3
00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:10.260
[Jinwoo] <i>Miss Jeong Jian?</i>

4
00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.388
<i>Uh. Mr. Jeong Jinman has been found dead.</i>

5
00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:17.100
[Jian] This is what my uncle sold?

6
00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:18.227
You being serious?

7
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:19.311
THEN… IS JEONG JINMAN DEAD?

8
00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:21.688
THEN… YOU'LL DIE TODAY TOO.
JEONG JIAN?

9
00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:22.981
[thudding sound]
[inhales sharply]

10
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.150
[gasps]

11
00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:28.278
[screams. grunts]

12
00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:30.948
[Seongjo] <i>Wow!</i>

13
00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.908
<i>The veteran warriors</i>
<i>have all gathered together!</i>

14
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.286
[shatters]

15
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.580
The first person who manages
to kill Jinman's niece

16
00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:39.790
or captures her alive

17
00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.250
will bring home a big fat bonus.

18
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.918
All right. the rabbit hunt begins!

19
00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.962
[thuds. whirs]

20
00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.922
[whirring]

21
00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:50.050
[Jinman] <i>Listen up. Jeong Jian.</i>

22
00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.385
<i>Whatever scares you.</i>

23
00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:53.845
<i>keep your eyes open and face it head-on.</i>

24
00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.266
[Minhye] <i>I see that you don't think</i>
<i>before you act.</i>

25
00:00:57.349 --> 00:00:59.017
<i>That's not what your uncle would do.</i>

26
00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:01.311
<i>Yes. on the floor</i>
<i>where your uncle did most of his work</i>

27
00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:03.522
<i>is a door that opens into Murthehelp.</i>

28
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.692
-No way.
-[thuds]

29
00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:07.901
[Jeongmin] It actually exists.

30
00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:10.237
[high-pitched ringing]

31
00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.947
Wait. no. please. it's too bright.

32
00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.991
You haven't answered my question yet!

33
00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.117
[Brother] Jeong Jian!

34
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.368
<i>D-d-don't trust him!</i>

35
00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:17.452
[gasps]

36
00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:18.745
Jeongmin!

37
00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:20.914
[♪ tense music playing]

38
00:01:20.998 --> 00:01:23.208
[Seongjo] <i>But there is something</i>
<i>you should know.</i>

39
00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:26.712
<i>Your Uncle Jinman killed</i>
<i>a lot of people too.</i>

40
00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:29.631
[Bale] <i>You and I both get paid</i>
<i>to kill people.</i>

41
00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:31.675
<i>Stop pretending to be righteous.</i>

42
00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:32.843
<i>It makes me sick.</i>

43
00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.304
<i>In the end. you and I</i>
<i>are more alike than you think.</i>

44
00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:41.476
[both grunting]

45
00:01:46.398 --> 00:01:47.858
[Bale] If you don't kill me here.

46
00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.318
I'll kill everyone.

47
00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:53.238
All your friends. and family. and anyone
who has anything to do with you.

48
00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:56.283
-[gasps]
-[Kuma] <i>You must be Jeong Jian.</i>

49
00:01:57.075 --> 00:01:59.494
-You really do take after your uncle.
-[heavy breathing]

50
00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:06.543
[Jian] That you. Master?

51
00:02:07.044 --> 00:02:08.503
[Pasin] <i>We don't have time. Jian.</i>

52
00:02:08.587 --> 00:02:09.755
Bale's after you.

53
00:02:09.838 --> 00:02:11.340
[Bale] You're up. you two.

54
00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:12.883
Go and handle this.

55
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.259
[engine revving]

56
00:02:14.343 --> 00:02:15.510
[crashes]

57
00:02:15.594 --> 00:02:17.137
[♪ tense music playing]

58
00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:19.848
Hey there. twins.

59
00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.642
Today is the day we go to Hell.

60
00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.395
[fighting grunts]

61
00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:35.364
[grunts]

62
00:02:35.447 --> 00:02:37.366
Jian. you better run!

63
00:02:37.449 --> 00:02:38.950
-Minhye!
-Get outta here!

64
00:02:39.034 --> 00:02:40.202
[cries]

65
00:02:42.496 --> 00:02:44.665
[Jinman] <i>I'll give you two options</i>
<i>to choose from.</i>

66
00:02:44.748 --> 00:02:47.834
<i>But ultimately.</i>
<i>the choice is yours to make.</i>

67
00:02:49.086 --> 00:02:51.129
-[Jian screams]
-[gunshots]

68
00:02:52.047 --> 00:02:54.633
[Seongjo exclaiming]

69
00:02:55.425 --> 00:02:56.426
[gunshot]

70
00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.471
[♪ tense music playing]

71
00:03:08.939 --> 00:03:09.940
[inhales]

72
00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.110
[screaming]

73
00:03:14.403 --> 00:03:15.737
[Bale] <i>It should be me…</i>

74
00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:17.572
[♪ soft tense music playing]

75
00:03:18.156 --> 00:03:19.616
<i>who takes his life away.</i>

76
00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.161
<i>Don't you think?</i>

77
00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:30.752
A SHOP FOR KILLERS 2

78
00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:34.005
[footsteps thudding]

79
00:03:34.089 --> 00:03:36.716
{\an8}[breathing heavily]

80
00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:49.521
{\an8}[♪ suspenseful music playing]

81
00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.071
[staff 1] Team Leader?

82
00:04:03.118 --> 00:04:05.203
[alarm wailing]

83
00:04:05.287 --> 00:04:06.538
What's going on?

84
00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.669
[grunts. groans]

85
00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.171
-[grunts]
-[groans]

86
00:04:17.424 --> 00:04:19.801
[staff 2] It's the server room! Move. now!

87
00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:23.388
[alarm wailing continues]

88
00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.188
[clicks]

89
00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.190
[sighs]

90
00:04:39.863 --> 00:04:44.409
[warped droning intensifies]

91
00:04:45.035 --> 00:04:48.413
[explosion]

92
00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.337
[♪ muffled suspenseful music playing]

93
00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.672
[high-pitched ringing]

94
00:05:15.524 --> 00:05:18.735
[♪ tense music intensifies]

95
00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:26.076
A SHOP FOR KILLERS 2

96
00:05:32.791 --> 00:05:35.710
EPISODE 01
JINMAN ON THE SAME DAY

97
00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:42.300
[♪ pensive music playing]

98
00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.788
[Jeongmin] Wait! Jeong Jinman!

99
00:06:12.414 --> 00:06:14.916
You have to let me down!

100
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.209
Hey. you fucker!

101
00:06:19.087 --> 00:06:20.255
[door opens]

102
00:06:36.438 --> 00:06:38.148
[Jeongmin laughing]

103
00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:42.444
[laughing continues]

104
00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:46.031
-[machines thudding]
-[alarm beeping]

105
00:06:51.786 --> 00:06:53.622
[cell phone buzzing]

106
00:06:58.168 --> 00:07:00.128
[Jinwoo] Time of death is 1900 hours.

107
00:07:00.211 --> 00:07:02.339
I've transferred the body
to the Hansarang Gyeongae Hospital

108
00:07:02.422 --> 00:07:04.049
mortuary in Yecheong County.

109
00:07:05.216 --> 00:07:07.719
His niece Jeong Jian
is his only surviving family.

110
00:07:07.802 --> 00:07:09.846
No need to involve Yecheong Police.

111
00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:16.936
[keys jingling]

112
00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:27.906
[lock clanking]

113
00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:45.048
[beeping]

114
00:07:46.675 --> 00:07:48.093
[lock clicks open]

115
00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.692
[♪ soft music playing]

116
00:08:03.775 --> 00:08:06.152
[clicking]

117
00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:09.114
[Jinwoo] North Korean defector.

118
00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:12.409
Can't believe you're still alive.

119
00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:14.703
Well. that's because security
in South Korea's

120
00:08:14.786 --> 00:08:16.246
-become soft since I've been gone.
-[chuckles]

121
00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:18.164
Look at you.

122
00:08:18.248 --> 00:08:20.041
You don't look like
you've come across any guards.

123
00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:21.126
-Hey.
-[chuckles]

124
00:08:21.209 --> 00:08:22.544
[laughs]

125
00:08:24.629 --> 00:08:26.047
Officer Jinwoo.

126
00:08:26.131 --> 00:08:27.215
Pasin.

127
00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:29.759
-[speaking Thai] Jinwoo-<i>krap.</i>
-[in English] How are you?

128
00:08:30.885 --> 00:08:31.970
You're working out too much.

129
00:08:32.053 --> 00:08:34.597
Yeah. well. for a cop.
you're a skinny little bitch.

130
00:08:34.681 --> 00:08:35.682
[chuckles]

131
00:08:35.765 --> 00:08:37.142
[door slides open]

132
00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:53.283
Starting now. we have 62 hours.

133
00:08:55.118 --> 00:08:56.161
Babylon…

134
00:08:57.162 --> 00:08:58.288
took our bait.

135
00:08:59.122 --> 00:09:01.458
[associate] <i>From the outside.</i>
<i>this place looks exactly like</i>

136
00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:03.418
<i>every other run-of-the-mill rice factory.</i>

137
00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:07.338
<i>One of the buildings even operates</i>
<i>as a rice warehouse.</i>

138
00:09:07.881 --> 00:09:09.132
<i>But it's just a cover.</i>

139
00:09:09.924 --> 00:09:14.054
{\an8}<i>A full one-kilometer radius spanning</i>
<i>all directions is completely flat land.</i>

140
00:09:15.138 --> 00:09:17.515
{\an8}<i>Anyone approaching</i>
<i>will be spotted immediately.</i>

141
00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:19.851
{\an8}<i>This place is a fortress.</i>

142
00:09:21.352 --> 00:09:23.480
[whooshing]

143
00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:28.193
[whirs]

144
00:09:28.276 --> 00:09:30.737
[alarm wailing]

145
00:09:32.614 --> 00:09:34.616
The assholes have upgraded.

146
00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:36.618
Now we have to get around all of that.

147
00:09:38.661 --> 00:09:39.662
[sighs]

148
00:09:39.746 --> 00:09:43.291
[associate] Most of Babylon's facilities
are installed on their basement floors.

149
00:09:43.374 --> 00:09:44.918
The armory is on basement four.

150
00:09:45.001 --> 00:09:47.253
The situation room. basement two.

151
00:09:47.337 --> 00:09:49.714
There's a 30-millimeter AA gun
on the rooftop.

152
00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:52.967
[associate] Ninety-six soldiers
of Babylon's mobile force

153
00:09:53.051 --> 00:09:54.469
are active until 6:00 p.m.

154
00:09:54.552 --> 00:09:58.223
But. Jinman. it's supposed
to be a surprise. isn't it?

155
00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.476
It would be better
to kill Bale somewhere else.

156
00:10:05.188 --> 00:10:06.231
[Jinman] This is the target.

157
00:10:06.981 --> 00:10:08.066
[burbling]

158
00:10:08.149 --> 00:10:09.442
[Pasin] <i>The server?</i>

159
00:10:09.526 --> 00:10:12.153
[Jinman] <i>It houses all</i>
<i>of Babylon's classified files.</i>

160
00:10:12.237 --> 00:10:14.823
<i>They've been around</i>
<i>since the military dictatorship.</i>

161
00:10:14.906 --> 00:10:17.242
<i>Babylon's carried out</i>
<i>all the intelligence operations.</i>

162
00:10:17.325 --> 00:10:19.119
<i>kidnappings. and assassinations</i>

163
00:10:19.202 --> 00:10:20.829
<i>on behalf of every changing regime.</i>

164
00:10:20.912 --> 00:10:23.790
Including selling North Korea weapons
behind our government's back.

165
00:10:24.749 --> 00:10:27.168
In the conflict zones
of Southeast and Central Asia.

166
00:10:27.252 --> 00:10:30.213
<i>they made arms deals</i>
<i>with both rebels and government forces.</i>

167
00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:32.924
Political coups were engineered
for their own gain.

168
00:10:33.007 --> 00:10:34.092
Decades of client lists.

169
00:10:34.175 --> 00:10:35.510
intelligence operatives.

170
00:10:35.593 --> 00:10:37.137
all their contract kill data.

171
00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.930
Everything top secret
is being kept in there.

172
00:10:43.351 --> 00:10:45.770
Bale killed hundreds of civilians
during operations.

173
00:10:46.938 --> 00:10:48.940
<i>That evidence is buried there as well.</i>

174
00:10:49.941 --> 00:10:51.818
This is our bargaining chip.

175
00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:55.613
Babylon will have no choice
but to be kept in check.

176
00:10:55.697 --> 00:10:58.533
The result is a maintained
state of neutrality.

177
00:11:00.827 --> 00:11:02.203
If our plan fails…

178
00:11:04.581 --> 00:11:07.709
this exhausting.
useless war will never end for us.

179
00:11:09.377 --> 00:11:12.422
Jian deserves to live a full
and peaceful life.

180
00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.300
[Jinman] We can't fail.

181
00:11:16.259 --> 00:11:18.386
Jian needs us to protect her
with this shield.

182
00:11:19.012 --> 00:11:20.680
[Jinwoo] Can't we just hack the data?

183
00:11:20.763 --> 00:11:22.348
Impossible. [clicks tongue]

184
00:11:22.432 --> 00:11:24.767
In order to keep it secure
and to prevent overheating.

185
00:11:24.851 --> 00:11:27.020
they keep it separate
from the general server room

186
00:11:27.103 --> 00:11:29.397
and store it independently underwater.

187
00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.899
This wall is made of concrete

188
00:11:30.982 --> 00:11:32.609
and serves as the firewall.

189
00:11:32.692 --> 00:11:33.902
[sighs]

190
00:11:33.985 --> 00:11:37.071
Even so. it has to be connected
to somewhere outside. right?

191
00:11:37.155 --> 00:11:39.824
True. but it's still submerged underwater.

192
00:11:39.908 --> 00:11:40.909
[sighs]

193
00:11:40.992 --> 00:11:43.369
Ah. even a Kim Il Sung University elite

194
00:11:43.453 --> 00:11:44.579
is stumped. huh? [clicks tongue]

195
00:11:44.662 --> 00:11:46.664
Collect the reward and report the spy.

196
00:11:47.916 --> 00:11:49.792
This asshole's useless.

197
00:11:49.876 --> 00:11:51.419
What do you propose instead?

198
00:11:52.503 --> 00:11:53.963
We're removing the whole thing.

199
00:11:54.589 --> 00:11:56.341
[associate] <i>At 1500 hours every day.</i>

200
00:11:56.424 --> 00:11:59.010
<i>the server is raised</i>
<i>from the water tank for inspection.</i>

201
00:11:59.093 --> 00:12:01.179
[Pasin] <i>Great. We'll hack it then.</i>

202
00:12:01.721 --> 00:12:04.933
What the hell. how'd this Thai idiot
ever work with Babylon?

203
00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.894
You should keep your dumb mouth shut.
[clicks tongue]

204
00:12:07.977 --> 00:12:09.103
Watch your step. man.

205
00:12:09.187 --> 00:12:10.355
[water trickling]

206
00:12:10.438 --> 00:12:13.107
[machine whirring. beeping]

207
00:12:17.779 --> 00:12:18.988
[heavy thud]

208
00:12:25.411 --> 00:12:28.164
[♪ tense music playing]

209
00:12:31.251 --> 00:12:32.877
[associate] <i>This is our chance.</i>

210
00:12:32.961 --> 00:12:35.004
<i>But we'll only have 20 minutes.</i>

211
00:12:35.797 --> 00:12:39.300
Infiltrating the enemy network
and downloading the data that quickly?

212
00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.511
It's impossible even for Zuckerberg.

213
00:12:41.594 --> 00:12:42.720
Zuck. who… who is that?

214
00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:44.097
Just say hacking. come on.

215
00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.348
Thai genius.

216
00:12:45.431 --> 00:12:46.641
You're gonna have to be the one

217
00:12:46.724 --> 00:12:48.893
that brings the new-model bomb
to my location.

218
00:12:48.977 --> 00:12:50.228
Oh. yeah?

219
00:12:50.311 --> 00:12:51.312
Why is that?

220
00:12:51.396 --> 00:12:52.480
Because you're good.

221
00:12:52.563 --> 00:12:54.524
[Jinman] <i>We can't take weapons</i>
<i>inside Babylon.</i>

222
00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:56.234
<i>so we'll go through the armory.</i>

223
00:12:56.317 --> 00:12:58.820
<i>Team leaders and up</i>
<i>can carry personal sidearms.</i>

224
00:12:58.903 --> 00:13:00.822
but they're only allowed
to access the ammo

225
00:13:00.905 --> 00:13:02.365
during an active operation.

226
00:13:03.616 --> 00:13:04.617
[smacks lips]

227
00:13:05.243 --> 00:13:06.869
The armory has what we need.

228
00:13:06.953 --> 00:13:08.788
We'll have to raid it for weapons.

229
00:13:08.871 --> 00:13:11.541
[Jinman] <i>In the explosive section.</i>
<i>you'll find the E5 bombs.</i>

230
00:13:11.624 --> 00:13:14.794
<i>which were specially manufactured</i>
<i>as miniature bunker-busters.</i>

231
00:13:14.877 --> 00:13:18.298
With those. we'll blast into the rooms
above and below the server.

232
00:13:18.381 --> 00:13:21.301
I take the bombs
and blast it into the server?

233
00:13:21.384 --> 00:13:25.513
Pasin. you also have to plant a bomb
above the server on the first floor.

234
00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:27.390
That'll be really tough.

235
00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.225
Why can't you stop complaining?

236
00:13:30.268 --> 00:13:31.436
I have it just as bad.

237
00:13:31.519 --> 00:13:32.854
Look over there.

238
00:13:32.937 --> 00:13:34.731
It's not always about the big things.

239
00:13:34.814 --> 00:13:37.859
The most physical things
aren't always the toughest.

240
00:13:40.069 --> 00:13:41.320
My issue…

241
00:13:42.321 --> 00:13:44.907
is figuring out what bait
will reel this guy in.

242
00:13:46.659 --> 00:13:47.702
[sighs]

243
00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:54.792
BEAUTIFUL FEMALE MASSEUSE!!
ALWAYS ON STANDBY!!

244
00:13:54.876 --> 00:13:56.335
PREMIUM-QUALITY MASSAGE
GRAND OPENING SPECIAL!

245
00:13:59.464 --> 00:14:00.715
[sighs]

246
00:14:02.425 --> 00:14:03.468
DELETE MESSAGES

247
00:14:09.974 --> 00:14:12.477
[door opens. closes]

248
00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.479
DELETE ALL

249
