512
00:32:59.936 --> 00:33:01.563
I'm sorry about this. Truly.

513
00:33:01.646 --> 00:33:03.648
Uh. it's protocol. so I have to do it.

514
00:33:03.732 --> 00:33:04.858
[guard] Phoenix.

515
00:33:06.776 --> 00:33:10.197
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

516
00:33:10.280 --> 00:33:12.824
Password. password. password.

517
00:33:12.908 --> 00:33:13.992
[Cheolseung] What is it?

518
00:33:14.075 --> 00:33:15.368
These Babylon assholes.

519
00:33:15.452 --> 00:33:17.120
I've never done this before.

520
00:33:21.082 --> 00:33:23.960
[♪ tense music playing]

521
00:33:24.044 --> 00:33:26.087
What's the stupid password? Shit.

522
00:33:27.047 --> 00:33:28.840
I told you to open it.

523
00:33:28.924 --> 00:33:30.800
I'm just following the procedure here.

524
00:33:30.884 --> 00:33:32.135
It's all right.

525
00:33:34.888 --> 00:33:35.889
Rifle.

526
00:33:36.765 --> 00:33:37.807
Are we good?

527
00:33:37.891 --> 00:33:40.310
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

528
00:33:42.395 --> 00:33:43.563
{\an8}CODE: PHOENIX / RIFFLE

529
00:33:44.689 --> 00:33:45.857
[exasperated sigh]

530
00:33:46.566 --> 00:33:49.569
That was tougher than clearing mines
on the demarcation line.

531
00:33:50.070 --> 00:33:51.112
[sighs]

532
00:33:51.196 --> 00:33:52.197
[inhales]

533
00:33:52.948 --> 00:33:54.616
I'm moving to my next position.

534
00:33:54.699 --> 00:33:55.784
[elevator bell dings]

535
00:33:56.785 --> 00:33:59.496
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

536
00:34:12.092 --> 00:34:13.718
[metallic clanking]

537
00:34:13.802 --> 00:34:17.555
[metallic clanking continues]

538
00:34:22.227 --> 00:34:23.770
[trilling]

539
00:34:26.147 --> 00:34:27.148
[beeps]

540
00:34:27.232 --> 00:34:29.401
[♪ upbeat music playing]

541
00:34:34.322 --> 00:34:35.573
Okay.

542
00:34:35.657 --> 00:34:37.701
Cheolseung's moved
into his second position.

543
00:34:37.784 --> 00:34:38.994
Standby.

544
00:34:39.077 --> 00:34:41.871
[♪ upbeat music continues]

545
00:34:53.174 --> 00:34:54.592
[Jinwoo] <i>Ten minutes remaining.</i>

546
00:34:55.343 --> 00:34:56.970
Armory CCTVs?

547
00:34:57.053 --> 00:34:58.471
[Cheolseung] <i>They're no problem.</i>

548
00:34:59.264 --> 00:35:00.515
DANGER

549
00:35:11.860 --> 00:35:13.445
I'm returning my gun.

550
00:35:16.072 --> 00:35:17.073
[beeps]

551
00:35:18.241 --> 00:35:19.868
[whirring]

552
00:35:25.665 --> 00:35:28.793
EXPLOSIVE MATERIALS
WARNING EXPLOSIVE MATERIAL

553
00:35:28.877 --> 00:35:31.504
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

554
00:35:50.482 --> 00:35:51.483
[beeps]

555
00:36:21.429 --> 00:36:22.639
[alarm wails]

556
00:36:22.722 --> 00:36:23.890
[clicks]

557
00:36:24.307 --> 00:36:27.018
[whirring. rattling]

558
00:36:28.770 --> 00:36:30.230
[whirring]

559
00:36:30.313 --> 00:36:32.399
[trills. beeps]

560
00:36:33.358 --> 00:36:35.360
{\an8}[Jinwoo] <i>It's almost time.</i>
<i>What's going on?</i>

561
00:36:38.905 --> 00:36:40.865
[whirring]

562
00:36:40.949 --> 00:36:44.369
[machine beeping]

563
00:36:49.666 --> 00:36:50.959
What is it?

564
00:36:51.042 --> 00:36:52.627
Someone tell me what's going on.

565
00:36:52.711 --> 00:36:53.920
[heavy thud]

566
00:36:59.008 --> 00:37:00.427
[scraping]

567
00:37:03.555 --> 00:37:07.225
[♪ tense music playing]

568
00:37:34.461 --> 00:37:35.545
[grunts]

569
00:37:41.551 --> 00:37:43.553
Now is your only chance.

570
00:37:58.485 --> 00:37:59.736
[electric crackling]

571
00:38:07.410 --> 00:38:08.703
[whirs]

572
00:38:12.165 --> 00:38:13.208
[grunts]

573
00:38:13.291 --> 00:38:15.794
[panting]

574
00:38:18.922 --> 00:38:20.131
[door closes]

575
00:38:20.215 --> 00:38:21.216
Uh. Chief?

576
00:38:21.800 --> 00:38:24.677
I think we need to check
Team Leader Bale's location.

577
00:38:24.761 --> 00:38:26.012
Why?

578
00:38:26.095 --> 00:38:28.681
I walked past him in the situation room
a few minutes ago.

579
00:38:28.765 --> 00:38:31.559
but then. two minutes later.
I ran into him on a different floor.

580
00:38:31.643 --> 00:38:34.646
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

581
00:38:49.911 --> 00:38:50.912
[grunts]

582
00:38:57.544 --> 00:38:58.670
[groans]

583
00:39:16.396 --> 00:39:19.524
[panting]

584
00:39:22.610 --> 00:39:23.903
Huh?

585
00:39:23.987 --> 00:39:26.197
Team Leader Bale has two cars on site?

586
00:39:30.743 --> 00:39:33.454
[♪ tense music playing]

587
00:39:38.042 --> 00:39:39.252
[creaking]

588
00:39:39.335 --> 00:39:42.380
[♪ tense music continues]

589
00:39:46.301 --> 00:39:47.635
[Jinman grunts]

590
00:39:48.928 --> 00:39:50.054
[strained grunt]

591
00:39:51.264 --> 00:39:52.265
[sighs]

592
00:40:04.152 --> 00:40:05.403
The inspection is complete.

593
00:40:06.779 --> 00:40:07.780
[beeps]

594
00:40:09.073 --> 00:40:10.158
[whirs]

595
00:40:18.666 --> 00:40:20.126
I have to go down.

596
00:40:20.209 --> 00:40:21.628
Something weird's going on.

597
00:40:21.711 --> 00:40:23.254
Hey. wait a sec.

598
00:40:23.338 --> 00:40:24.464
What are you going to do?

599
00:40:30.762 --> 00:40:33.222
[door whirs open]

600
00:40:34.307 --> 00:40:38.645
[machine beeping]

601
00:40:48.446 --> 00:40:50.865
[both grunting]

602
00:40:50.949 --> 00:40:52.033
[groans]

603
00:40:53.743 --> 00:40:54.744
[grunts]

604
00:40:54.827 --> 00:40:57.121
[breathing heavily]

605
00:40:57.789 --> 00:40:58.873
[loud thud]

606
00:40:58.957 --> 00:41:00.166
[Cheolseung panting]

607
00:41:03.795 --> 00:41:05.338
Ah. shit.

608
00:41:06.506 --> 00:41:08.841
[panting]

609
00:41:09.425 --> 00:41:10.510
[sighs]

610
00:41:11.302 --> 00:41:13.763
[panting]

611
00:41:15.223 --> 00:41:17.100
I took care of the first floor.

612
00:41:17.183 --> 00:41:19.936
I was waiting forever.
I thought you died in there.

613
00:41:21.688 --> 00:41:22.730
[exhales]

614
00:41:23.439 --> 00:41:25.191
Glad you're alive.

615
00:41:26.067 --> 00:41:27.276
I won't die today.

616
00:41:27.360 --> 00:41:29.779
[panting]

617
00:41:29.862 --> 00:41:30.863
Or ever.

618
00:41:33.825 --> 00:41:37.078
Check the route and radius of movement
to see where that vehicle came from.

619
00:41:37.161 --> 00:41:38.579
and run a malware scan.

620
00:41:38.663 --> 00:41:40.581
-We could've been hacked.
-Yes. sir.

621
00:41:42.875 --> 00:41:45.628
[drones whirring]

622
00:41:45.712 --> 00:41:48.131
[♪ intense music playing]

623
00:41:56.931 --> 00:41:58.099
[whirs]

624
00:41:58.850 --> 00:42:00.059
[beeping]

625
00:42:06.607 --> 00:42:07.817
[whirs]

626
00:42:07.900 --> 00:42:11.738
[beeping]

627
00:42:18.786 --> 00:42:22.498
[groaning]

628
00:42:22.582 --> 00:42:24.167
[Cheolseung]
<i>Server room installation complete.</i>

629
00:42:24.250 --> 00:42:25.418
Okay.

630
00:42:32.550 --> 00:42:34.343
Ah. shit.

631
00:42:35.303 --> 00:42:36.971
My location's been compromised.

632
00:42:46.397 --> 00:42:47.690
[staff] Team two has arrived.

633
00:42:47.774 --> 00:42:48.941
Ten minutes to entry.

634
00:42:49.442 --> 00:42:50.443
General.

635
00:42:51.903 --> 00:42:52.987
Jeong Jinman…

636
00:42:53.863 --> 00:42:55.281
Do you think he's still alive?

637
00:42:57.825 --> 00:42:58.868
[door opens]

638
00:43:04.207 --> 00:43:07.168
Sir. one of the drones has been shot.
and we've been hacked.

639
00:43:10.838 --> 00:43:12.799
What? What's wrong?

640
00:43:12.882 --> 00:43:17.220
[alarm wailing]

641
00:43:20.098 --> 00:43:22.683
Oh. shit. That son of a bitch.

642
00:43:26.729 --> 00:43:28.314
What's going on? Go find out.

643
00:43:32.860 --> 00:43:34.779
[explosion]

644
00:43:34.862 --> 00:43:36.697
[loud blast]

645
00:43:42.829 --> 00:43:46.082
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

646
00:43:55.216 --> 00:43:57.885
[♪ tense music playing]

647
00:44:41.179 --> 00:44:43.639
-[high-pitched warbling]
-[all groaning in pain]

648
00:44:43.723 --> 00:44:46.058
[groaning continues]

649
00:44:57.320 --> 00:44:59.947
17 MEO 4396

650
00:45:08.748 --> 00:45:11.375
[♪ tense music continues]

651
00:45:12.460 --> 00:45:13.836
[beeping]

652
00:45:13.920 --> 00:45:15.171
[explodes]

653
00:45:17.798 --> 00:45:20.760
[hissing]

654
00:45:45.243 --> 00:45:46.327
[Bale grunts]

655
00:45:47.662 --> 00:45:49.372
[Jinman grunts]

656
00:45:50.081 --> 00:45:51.082
[groans]

657
00:45:52.291 --> 00:45:54.418
-[grunts]
-[Jinman groans]

658
00:45:54.502 --> 00:45:57.296
[panting]

659
00:46:00.883 --> 00:46:02.176
[Bale] When I heard you were dead.

660
00:46:03.386 --> 00:46:05.137
I was so disappointed.

661
00:46:17.191 --> 00:46:19.318
[♪ dark. ominous music playing]

662
00:46:21.028 --> 00:46:22.029
What?

663
00:46:23.114 --> 00:46:24.198
You're not scared?

664
00:46:30.788 --> 00:46:33.874
[both grunting]

665
00:46:51.225 --> 00:46:52.893
[fierce grunts]

666
00:46:59.150 --> 00:47:00.943
[yells]

667
00:47:09.618 --> 00:47:10.953
[both groan]

668
00:47:11.037 --> 00:47:14.206
[♪ action music playing]

669
00:47:15.207 --> 00:47:16.667
[fighting grunts]

670
00:47:30.514 --> 00:47:32.433
-[Bale groans]
-[thuds]

671
00:47:32.516 --> 00:47:34.935
[panting]

672
00:47:35.019 --> 00:47:36.020
See you later.

673
00:47:40.816 --> 00:47:46.238
[inaudible screaming]

674
00:47:54.538 --> 00:47:58.125
[bomb timers beeping]

675
00:48:01.504 --> 00:48:04.006
[beeping continues]

676
00:48:04.090 --> 00:48:05.341
[explosion]

677
00:48:07.510 --> 00:48:09.512
[muffled explosion]

678
00:48:12.515 --> 00:48:15.101
[loud rumbling]

679
00:48:28.030 --> 00:48:29.031
[pants]

680
00:48:38.165 --> 00:48:40.334
[panting]

681
00:48:44.338 --> 00:48:45.464
[Yonghan] Jinman!

682
00:48:47.007 --> 00:48:48.342
It's over.

683
00:48:49.885 --> 00:48:51.429
It's time to end this.

684
00:48:51.512 --> 00:48:55.808
[drones whirring]

685
00:49:12.241 --> 00:49:13.909
[gunfire]

686
00:49:17.413 --> 00:49:20.082
[helicopter blades whirring]

687
00:49:31.594 --> 00:49:33.512
Shoot him down. idiots!

688
00:49:34.555 --> 00:49:36.098
[gunfire]

689
00:49:58.329 --> 00:50:01.165
[♪ tense music playing]

690
00:50:05.169 --> 00:50:06.170
[clatters]

691
00:50:24.480 --> 00:50:25.481
[sighs]

692
00:50:26.190 --> 00:50:30.569
[panting]

693
00:50:36.200 --> 00:50:39.203
[♪ somber music playing]

694
00:50:53.175 --> 00:50:54.343
[driver] It's dangerous out here.

695
00:50:54.426 --> 00:50:56.845
You should go back inside
and wait in the shopping mall.

696
00:50:56.929 --> 00:50:59.640
Sir. Someone is heading
this way right now.

697
00:51:01.809 --> 00:51:03.143
You just stay here.

698
00:51:03.978 --> 00:51:04.979
It's all right.

699
00:51:10.192 --> 00:51:12.486
[bird squawking]

700
00:51:16.240 --> 00:51:17.575
[driver] Are they one of ours?

701
00:51:18.826 --> 00:51:21.078
No. sir. they haven't been confirmed.

702
00:51:33.007 --> 00:51:35.384
[Jinwoo] Jinman. we're almost there.

703
00:51:36.051 --> 00:51:38.846
[labored breathing]

704
00:52:00.242 --> 00:52:02.244
[birds chirping]

705
00:52:06.498 --> 00:52:07.958
I know that man.

706
00:52:18.177 --> 00:52:19.178
[sighs]

707
00:52:21.972 --> 00:52:22.973
[grunts]

708
00:52:26.268 --> 00:52:29.355
[labored breathing]

709
00:52:33.233 --> 00:52:34.234
[relieved sigh]

710
00:52:36.070 --> 00:52:38.072
[♪ gentle music playing]

711
00:52:49.541 --> 00:52:51.210
[grunts. pants]

712
00:52:51.293 --> 00:52:53.545
[furious grunting]

713
00:53:10.771 --> 00:53:15.526
A SHOP FOR KILLERS 2

714
00:53:15.609 --> 00:53:17.569
{\an8}[♪ dark. ominous music playing]

715
00:53:18.946 --> 00:53:21.990
[♪ upbeat music playing]

716
00:53:22.074 --> 00:53:24.493
[♪ electronic dance music playing]

717
00:53:29.540 --> 00:53:31.375
[indistinct chatter]

718
00:53:38.716 --> 00:53:41.635
SIGMA

719
00:53:42.219 --> 00:53:45.013
[cell phone vibrating]

720
00:53:45.139 --> 00:53:46.849
[vibrating continues]

721
00:53:47.808 --> 00:53:49.309
{\an8}-Yeah?
-[Jun] Onee-chan.

722
00:53:49.393 --> 00:53:51.770
{\an8}<i>you're too old to be playing</i>
<i>around in clubs.</i>

723
00:53:51.854 --> 00:53:53.272
{\an8}I'm not playing.

724
00:53:53.355 --> 00:53:54.815
{\an8}-I'm working.
-[Jun scoffs]

725
00:53:54.898 --> 00:53:56.191
{\an8}[Jun] <i>How'd you get in?</i>

726
00:53:56.275 --> 00:53:59.611
{\an8}<i>Security must be slacking.</i>
<i>they let anyone in these days.</i>

727
00:53:59.695 --> 00:54:01.280
{\an8}You've got to be joking.

728
00:54:01.363 --> 00:54:04.158
{\an8}I can get in wherever I want.

729
00:54:04.241 --> 00:54:06.076
{\an8}[Jun laughing] <i>Yeah. you wish.</i>

730
00:54:07.953 --> 00:54:09.955
{\an8}I'm working. stop interfering.

731
00:54:10.038 --> 00:54:11.248
{\an8}What is it that you want?

732
00:54:11.331 --> 00:54:13.041
{\an8}[Jun] <i>The director is summoning you.</i>

733
00:54:14.042 --> 00:54:16.253
{\an8}What. why?

734
00:54:17.254 --> 00:54:19.089
{\an8}-[sighs]
-[Jun] <i>Jeong Jinman.</i>

735
00:54:19.173 --> 00:54:20.257
{\an8}<i>Do you remember him?</i>

736
00:54:24.136 --> 00:54:25.262
{\an8}I remember.

737
00:54:27.347 --> 00:54:30.309
[♪ closing theme music playing]
